@base = http://localhost:8787
@token = REEMPLAZAR_CON_ID_TOKEN_DE_GOOGLE

### Estado
GET {{base}}/api/health

### Catálogo
GET {{base}}/api/stories?page=1&limit=20&sort=newest

### Historia
GET {{base}}/api/stories/101

### Capítulo
GET {{base}}/api/stories/101/chapters/1

### Mi valoración
GET {{base}}/api/stories/101/rating
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Votar
PUT {{base}}/api/stories/101/rating
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"rating":5}

### Eliminar mi voto
DELETE {{base}}/api/stories/101/rating
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
